  "explanation": "Document d1 provides clear and direct evidence that the Swedish Biathlon Federation is a member of the International Biathlon Union (IBU). It states explicitly that the Federation is 'an integral member of the International Biathlon Union (IBU), the global authority governing the sport.' This is supported by additional contextual details, such as participation in the IBU Congress and adherence to IBU anti-doping policies. Document d2 introduces a fictional claim that the Swedish Biathlon Federation is a member of Kill Devil Hill, an American rock band, which is clearly marked as fictional and not based on real-world facts. Therefore, only the International Biathlon Union is retained as a valid and supported answer."
